<title>UK: SOCCER-SWEDEN BEAT SCOTLAND 4-1 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SWEDEN BEAT SCOTLAND 4-1 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>DUNDEE, Scotland 1996-11-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden beat Scotland 4-1</p>
<p>(halftime 0-1) in a European under-21 soccer championship group</p>
<p>four qualifier on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Scotland - Johannesson 40 own goal</p>
<p>Sweden - Pettersson 49, Lantz 55, Ljunberg 69 77</p>
<p>Attendance: 3,878</p>
<p>Group four standings (tabulate - played, won, drawn, lost,</p>
<p>goals for, against, points):</p>
<p> Belarus		4  3  1  0  9  3  10</p>
<p> Sweden		 4  3  0  1 11  5   9</p>
<p> Austria		3  1  1  1  5  4   4</p>
<p> Scotland	     4  1  1  2  2  8   4</p>
<p> Latvia		 4  0  2  2  0  4   2</p>
<p> Estonia		3  0  1  2  2  5   1</p>
</text>
